#ASSERT `What is the effect of the voting of the persons in whose names the shares stand` `a stock corporation` FALSE FALSE 2 1 1 0 0 EQUALS JUST `the vote is evenly split and each faction may vote the securities proportionally, or a person voting or a beneficiary may apply to appoint an additional person`
